DEFINITION  Homo sapiens heat shock protein family A (Hsp70) member 1 like
            (HSPA1L), RefSeqGene on chromosome 6.
ACCESSION   NG_011855
VERSION     NG_011855.1
KEYWORDS    RefSeq; RefSeqGene.
SOURCE      Homo sapiens (human)
  ORGANISM  Homo sapiens
            Eukaryota; Metazoa; Chordata; Craniata; Vertebrata; Euteleostomi;
